---
import { site } from "../site.config";
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="privacy-pill">
    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#075A45" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.5-3.4 8-8 9-4.6-1-8-4.5-8-9V6z"></path></svg>
    <span><span class="only-desktop">Private by default · Works offline · Your files never leave your Mac</span><span class="only-mobile">Private · Offline · Your files never leave your Mac</span></span>
  </div>
  <h1>Get your Mac's space back. Without the guesswork.</h1>
  <p class="hero-lede">
    <span class="only-desktop">Furl finds the caches, merged worktrees, forgotten downloads and leftover dev servers you don't need, tells you why, and uses the Trash by default so you can undo.</span>
    <span class="only-mobile">Finds caches, merged worktrees, forgotten downloads and leftover dev servers, tells you why, and uses the Trash by default so you can undo.</span>
  </p>
  <p class="hero-meta only-desktop">Free and open source · macOS 14 or later, Apple silicon and Intel · <a href={site.githubUrl}>View source on GitHub</a></p>
</section>
